411 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 290 0 R
/T (The background to this issue is also legal. Under international law, Afghanistan has obligations to ensure the right to education without discrimination and to protect children from harmful practices. The Convention on the Rights of the Child provides that every child has the right to education and that the best interests of the child must be a primary consideration.7 The Convention on the Elimination of All Forms of Discrimination against Women requires the elimination of discrimination against women and girls in education and public life.8 The  International Economic, Social, and Cultural Rights recognizes the right to education and equality in its enjoyment.9)
/E (The background to this issue is also legal. Under international law, Afghanistan has obligations to ensure the right to education without discrimination and to protect children from harmful practices. The Convention on the Rights of the Child provides that every child has the right to education and that the best interests of the child must be a primary consideration.7 The Convention on the Elimination of All Forms of Discrimination against Women requires the elimination of discrimination against women and girls in education and public life.8 The  International Economic, Social, and Cultural Rights recognizes the right to education and equality in its enjoyment.9)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [11 727 0 R 13 728 0 R 15 18 16 19]
>>
